{"id":"20aaef29b45de654","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-goal-clause.md","title":"Goal Clause","display":"df-goal-clause — Goal Clause","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-goal-clause","aliases":["57-df-goal-clause"],"display":"df-goal-clause — Goal Clause","depends_on":["[[57-df-horn-clause]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-goal-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-goal-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-goal-clause — Goal Clause"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq0\">\\(n\\geq0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot\">\\(\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\">\\(\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\)</span> 表示闭合负子句；分解为有序目标列时保留这一列作为归结状态的显式表示，不能从集合表示中推测选择位置。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}:\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\to\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}:\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\to\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是下述唯一解析函数；固定左结合和闭包变量顺序保证可逆解析。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\neg B_1,\\ldots,\\neg B_n\\rangle)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\neg B_1,\\ldots,\\neg B_n\\rangle)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\coloneqq\\{\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\},\\qquad\n(\\leftarrow)\\coloneqq\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\coloneqq\\{\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\},\\qquad\n(\\leftarrow)\\coloneqq\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\;\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)=\\vec A\\leftrightarrow G=(\\leftarrow\\vec A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\;\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\n\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)=\\vec A\\leftrightarrow G=(\\leftarrow\\vec A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量化变量列由全称闭包给出；空目标是矛盾公式，不再含有未声明的变量元组。归结中的代换作用于目标列原子后再重新闭包，而不是对已闭合句子作不起作用的自由代入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-horn-clause","status":"resolved","id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-horn-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\geq0$，$B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。$\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 表示闭合负子句；分解为有序目标列时保留这一列作为归结状态的显式表示，不能从集合表示中推测选择位置。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\geq0$，$B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。$\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 表示闭合负子句；分解为有序目标列时保留这一列作为归结状态的显式表示，不能从集合表示中推测选择位置。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}:\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\to\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\neg B_1,\\ldots,\\neg B_n\\rangle)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\coloneqq\\{\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\},\\qquad\n(\\leftarrow)\\coloneqq\\bot.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\;\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{<\\omega}\\quad\n\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)=\\vec A\\leftrightarrow G=(\\leftarrow\\vec A).","display":true}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"43bf0ac6633013d5","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}$，$k\\geq1$，$1\\leq i\\leq k$；见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-horn-clause]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。作为状态的目标原子列随 $G$ 显式固定。"},{"id":"d2f6edd30be06d05","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"e64933cc4ccfc533","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":